33 SMC members along with 194 student representatives 122 girls capacitated on roles and responsibilities on gender leadership development inclusive education and child rights to address school dropout
186 members 138 girls females of youth groups capacitated in reducing child marriage prevent violence against women and children leadership development responsible citizen reducing drop out from school raise voice against harasser"></actual>
