  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the number of girls and boys from urban slums who completes quality education in primary and secondary school level in Dhaka</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="275178" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The dropout rate of students living in slums in targeted schools</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="A % (and #) average dropout of students living in slums across the targeted primary schools
B % (and #) average dropout of students living in slums across the targeted secondary schools"></target>
     <actual value="The project was unable to measure the dropout rate of students living in slums across the targeted lower secondary schools outcome indicator as the Bangladeshi government declared auto promotion for all students in 2022

Nevertheless distinguished achievements have been accomplished in 2022 contributing to reducing the school dropout This includes improving the quality of the education creating a girl friendly learning environment at school through Gender Equity Movement in Schools GEMS gender responsive inclusive pedagogy training psychosocial counselling training to teachers and maintaining close and functional relations with Directorate of Secondary and Higher Education DSHE During 2022 the 22 targeted schools positively welcomed safeguarding mechanisms forming Child protection Committees and practices creating a safe and gender responsive learning environment It is also worthwhile mentioning that the activities added as part of the non cost extension of the project"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target></target>
     <actual></actual>
    </period>
